#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:9 cd0b6867d78f4a90a11b274ba11c891d
msgid ""
"The primary method for tool discovery is ``list_built_in_tools()``, which"
" provides comprehensive information about all available tools. This "
"method supports multiple modes to help you understand tools from "
"different perspectives and access tool data in various formats."
msgstr "工具发现的主要方法是``list_built_in_tools()``，它提供了关于所有可用工具的全面信息。此方法支持多种模式，帮助您从不同角度了解工具，并以多种格式访问工具数据。"

