#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:48 a1b7dd992df248f1b71dabcca7348b73
msgid ""
"The ``list_built_in_tools()`` method supports several modes for different"
" use cases:"
msgstr "``list_built_in_tools()`` 方法支持多种模式以适应不同的使用场景："

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:51 8f493653237445fc83b7baf0b25585a6
