#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:53 8de9cd8164614fbbaa126d80dc3b0342
msgid "Returns a simple list of all tool names, sorted alphabetically."
msgstr "返回按字母顺序排序的所有工具名称的简单列表。"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:62 a56b49edf72140b19c4d6412e1469c28
msgid ""
"**Use cases:** - Quick tool name lookup - Building tool selection "
"interfaces - Tool name validation - Simple tool counting"
msgstr ""
"**使用场景：**  \n"
"- 快速查找工具名称  \n"
"- 构建工具选择界面  \n"
"- 工具名称验证  \n"
"- 简单的工具计数"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:69 00b2c6398b1444978a82801d189a53e3
msgid "List Spec Mode"
msgstr "列表规格模式"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:71 58e35dc98ec44d9590dc5dba0f519388
msgid "Returns a list of all tool specifications (complete tool configurations)."
msgstr "返回所有工具规格（完整工具配置）的列表。"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:83 da25536870574fdba64f9d5edd1a16eb
msgid ""
"**Use cases:** - Accessing complete tool configurations - Tool metadata "
"analysis - Building tool databases - Tool specification validation"
msgstr ""
"**使用场景：**  \n"
"- 访问完整的工具配置  \n"
"- 工具元数据分析  \n"
"- 构建工具数据库  \n"
"- 工具规格验证"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:90 77f88c516efa489eb866e4c9ac0de7ca
msgid "Config Mode (Default)"
msgstr "配置模式（默认）"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:92 3d04dd46b15b49fab9deb51b9833d75f
msgid ""
"The config mode organizes tools by their configuration file categories, "
"representing logical groupings by functionality or data source."
msgstr "配置模式根据工具的配置文件类别进行组织，按功能或数据来源对其进行逻辑分组。"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:101 e80bdf06a9e2442dafc215e16ff85821
msgid ""
"**Use cases:** - Understanding what data sources are available - Finding "
"tools by functional area (e.g., clinical trials, drug information, "
"literature search) - Getting an overview of scientific domains covered"
msgstr ""
"**使用场景：**  \n"
"- 了解可用的数据源  \n"
"- 按功能领域查找工具（例如，临床试验、药物信息、文献检索）  \n"
"- 获取涵盖的科学领域概览"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:106 a364484295b5404ebbd281dbc240dfcd
msgid ""
"**Example categories:** - ``fda_drug_label`` - FDA drug labeling tools - "
"``clinical_trials`` - Clinical trials data tools - ``semantic_scholar`` -"
" Academic literature tools - ``opentarget`` - OpenTargets platform tools "
"- ``chembl`` - ChEMBL database tools"
msgstr ""
"**示例类别：**  \n"
"- ``fda_drug_label`` - FDA药物标签工具  \n"
"- ``clinical_trials`` - 临床试验数据工具  \n"
"- ``semantic_scholar`` - 学术文献工具  \n"
"- ``opentarget`` - OpenTargets平台工具  \n"
"- ``chembl`` - ChEMBL数据库工具"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:114 a429535b44dd4e1b9d0191ce60ce8f34
msgid "Type Mode"
msgstr "类型模式"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:116 861bc4fa71164b09b399827c07b288ae
msgid ""
"The type mode organizes tools by their implementation classes, showing "
"the technical categorization of tools."
msgstr "类型模式根据工具的实现类进行组织，展示工具的技术分类。"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:123 7b1aadaa60854380a06f54704828630a
msgid ""
"**Use cases:** - Understanding the technical architecture - Finding tools"
" by implementation pattern - Debugging and development work - Tool "
"composition and workflow building"
msgstr ""
"**使用场景：**  \n"
"- 了解技术架构  \n"
"- 按实现模式查找工具  \n"
"- 调试与开发工作  \n"
"- 工具组合与工作流构建"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:129 06702a9dad78413a8adc0d6e0523f32c
msgid ""
"**Example types:** - ``FDADrugLabel`` - FDA drug labeling tool "
"implementations - ``OpenTarget`` - OpenTargets API tool implementations -"
" ``ChEMBLTool`` - ChEMBL database tool implementations - "
"``MCPAutoLoaderTool`` - MCP client auto-loading tools"
msgstr ""
"**示例类型：**  \n"
"- ``FDADrugLabel`` - FDA药物标签工具实现  \n"
"- ``OpenTarget`` - OpenTargets API工具实现  \n"
"- ``ChEMBLTool`` - ChEMBL数据库工具实现  \n"
"- ``MCPAutoLoaderTool`` - MCP客户端自动加载工具"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:136 192d03b3394d49088a4acf788a289563
msgid "Scan All Option"
msgstr "扫描全部选项"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:138 c32add6346c245839557e984d260531c
msgid ""
"All modes support the ``scan_all`` parameter to control how tools are "
"discovered:"
msgstr "所有模式均支持 ``scan_all`` 参数，用于控制工具的发现方式："

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:148 e0e21b1ab2c94246ae53e14099ca0872
msgid ""
"**When to use scan_all=True:** - Discovering tools not in predefined "
"mappings - Finding tools in custom or additional JSON files - "
"Comprehensive tool discovery - Development and testing"
msgstr ""
"**何时使用 scan_all=True：**  \n"
"- 发现未包含在预定义映射中的工具  \n"
"- 查找自定义或附加的 JSON 文件中的工具  \n"
"- 全面工具发现  \n"
"- 开发与测试"

#: ../../guide/listing_tools.rst:154 9eff39b6613844efaaf1c0fbc86924d1
msgid ""
"**When to use scan_all=False (default):** - Production environments "
"(faster) - Standard tool discovery - When you only need predefined tools"
msgstr ""
"**何时使用 scan_all=False（默认值）：**  \n"
"- 生产环境（更快）  \n"
"- 标准工具发现  \n"
"- 仅需预定义工具时"

